error[E0277]: `?` couldn't convert the error: `errlanes::kind::Fail: IntoFail` is not satisfied
  --> tests/coherence/carrier_fail/fail_rejection_change_question_mark.rs:14:10
   |
13 | fn outer(inner: Result<(), Fail<Child, lanes!(Fatal)>>) -> Result<(), Fail<Parent, lanes!(Fatal)>> {
   |                                                            --------------------------------------- required `errlanes::kind::Fail: IntoFail` because of this
14 |     inner?;
   |     -----^ the trait `IntoFail` is not implemented for `errlanes::kind::Fail`
   |     |
   |     this can't be annotated with `?` because it has type `Result<_, errlanes::Fail<Child, Profile<false, false, true>>>`
   |
   = note: the question mark operation (`?`) implicitly performs a conversion on the error value using the `From` trait
   = note: required for `errlanes::Fail<Parent, Profile<false, false, true>>` to implement `From<errlanes::Fail<Child, Profile<false, false, true>>>`
